{
  "id": "PRO.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 3",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't forget what I teach you, my child. Always remember what I tell you to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My teaching will give you a long and prosperous life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never let go of loyalty and faithfulness. Tie them round your neck; write them on your heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 2.52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you do this, both God and people will be pleased with you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Trust in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with all your heart. Never rely on what you think you know. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in everything you do, and he will show you the right way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.12.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 12.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never let yourself think that you are wiser than you are; simply obey the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and refuse to do wrong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you do, it will be like good medicine, healing your wounds and easing your pains. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Honour the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " by making him an offering from the best of all that your land produces. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you do, your barns will be filled with grain, and you will have too much wine to be able to store it all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
