          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Job 5.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.5+HEB.12.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12.5–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " corrects you, my child, pay close attention and take it as a warning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 3.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " corrects those he loves, as parents correct a child of whom they are proud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Happy is anyone who becomes wise — who gains understanding. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is more profit in it than there is in silver; it is worth more to you than gold. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom is more valuable than jewels; nothing you could want can compare with it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom offers you long life, as well as wealth and honour. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wisdom can make your life pleasant and lead you safely through it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Those who become wise are happy; wisdom will give them life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hold on to your wisdom and insight, my child. Never let them get away from you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will provide you with life — a pleasant and happy life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can go safely on your way and never even stumble. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will not be afraid when you go to bed, and you will sleep soundly through the night. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will not have to worry about sudden disasters, such as come on the wicked like a storm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will keep you safe. He will not let you fall into a trap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever you possibly can, do good to those who need it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Never tell your neighbours to wait until tomorrow if you can help them now. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't plan anything that will hurt your neighbours; they live beside you, trusting you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't argue with others for no reason when they have never done you any harm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
